body:
Related to #244 .  We should allow for automatic schema evolution when writing to an Iceberg table. This feature should be controlled by a flag, since it may not always be desirable to automatically evolve a table's schema .
Today I don't think we throw a good error message when the schema being written to a table is evolved. If we decide to control the schema evolution as an optional feature, we should also provide a good error message when the table has disabled automatic schema evolution.
@rdblue, @fbocse  thoughts?
